    "Add OSLogPreferences to the target app’s Debug Info.plist:\ncom.apple.SwiftUI → Events → Enable-Private-Data = YES\ncom.apple.diagnostics.events → SwiftUI → Enable-Private-Data = YES\nRelaunch the app, reconnect, and start a new capture." : {
      "comment" : "Setup instructions for revealing private SwiftUI log data",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "أضف OSLogPreferences إلى ملف Info.plist الخاص ببناء Debug للتطبيق الهدف:\ncom.apple.SwiftUI → Events → Enable-Private-Data = YES\ncom.apple.diagnostics.events → SwiftUI → Enable-Private-Data = YES\nأعد تشغيل التطبيق، وأعد الاتصال، ثم ابدأ التقاطًا جديدًا."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Füge die OSLogPreferences zur Debug-Info.plist der Ziel-App hinzu:\ncom.apple.SwiftUI → Events → Enable-Private-Data = YES\ncom.apple.diagnostics.events → SwiftUI → Enable-Private-Data = YES\nStarte die App neu, verbinde sie erneut und starte eine neue Aufnahme."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add OSLogPreferences to the target app’s Debug Info.plist:\ncom.apple.SwiftUI → Events → Enable-Private-Data = YES\ncom.apple.diagnostics.events → SwiftUI → Enable-Private-Data = YES\nRelaunch the app, reconnect, and start a new capture."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Añade OSLogPreferences al Info.plist de Debug de la app de destino:\ncom.apple.SwiftUI → Events → Enable-Private-Data = YES\ncom.apple.diagnostics.events → SwiftUI → Enable-Private-Data = YES\nVuelve a abrir la app, reconecta e inicia una captura nueva."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ajoutez OSLogPreferences au Info.plist Debug de l’app cible :\ncom.apple.SwiftUI → Events → Enable-Private-Data = YES\ncom.apple.diagnostics.events → SwiftUI → Enable-Private-Data = YES\nRelancez l’app, reconnectez-la, puis démarrez une nouvelle capture."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aggiungi OSLogPreferences al file Info.plist di Debug dell’app di destinazione:\ncom.apple.SwiftUI → Events → Enable-Private-Data = YES\ncom.apple.diagnostics.events → SwiftUI → Enable-Private-Data = YES\nRiapri l’app, riconnettiti e avvia una nuova cattura."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ターゲットAppのDebug Info.plistにOSLogPreferencesを追加します。\ncom.apple.SwiftUI → Events → Enable-Private-Data = YES\ncom.apple.diagnostics.events → SwiftUI → Enable-Private-Data = YES\nAppを再起動して再接続し、新しいキャプチャを開始してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "대상 앱의 디버그 Info.plist에 OSLogPreferences를 추가하세요.\ncom.apple.SwiftUI → Events → Enable-Private-Data = YES\ncom.apple.diagnostics.events → SwiftUI → Enable-Private-Data = YES\n앱을 다시 실행하고, 다시 연결한 다음, 새 캡처를 시작하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adicione OSLogPreferences ao Info.plist de Debug do app de destino:\ncom.apple.SwiftUI → Events → Enable-Private-Data = YES\ncom.apple.diagnostics.events → SwiftUI → Enable-Private-Data = YES\nAbra o app novamente, reconecte e inicie uma nova captura."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Добавьте OSLogPreferences в Debug Info.plist целевого приложения:\ncom.apple.SwiftUI → Events → Enable-Private-Data = YES\ncom.apple.diagnostics.events → SwiftUI → Enable-Private-Data = YES\nПерезапустите приложение, подключитесь снова и начните новый захват."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Thêm OSLogPreferences vào Debug Info.plist của ứng dụng đích:\ncom.apple.SwiftUI → Events → Enable-Private-Data = YES\ncom.apple.diagnostics.events → SwiftUI → Enable-Private-Data = YES\nMở lại ứng dụng, kết nối lại và bắt đầu lần ghi mới."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在目标 App 的 Debug Info.plist 中添加 OSLogPreferences：\ncom.apple.SwiftUI → Events → Enable-Private-Data = YES\ncom.apple.diagnostics.events → SwiftUI → Enable-Private-Data = YES\n重新启动 App，重新连接，然后开始新的捕获。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請在目標 App 的 Debug Info.plist 中加入 OSLogPreferences：\ncom.apple.SwiftUI → Events → Enable-Private-Data = YES\ncom.apple.diagnostics.events → SwiftUI → Enable-Private-Data = YES\n重新開啟 App、重新連線，然後開始新的擷取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
