        }
      }
    },
    "The LookInside Injector daemon requires your approval.\nOpen System Settings → Login Items & Extensions, locate “LookInside Injector”, and turn it on, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تتطلب عملية LookInside Injector الخلفية موافقتك.\nافتح إعدادات النظام → عناصر تسجيل الدخول والإضافات، وابحث عن “LookInside Injector” وفعّله، ثم حاول مرة أخرى."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der LookInside-Injector-Daemon benötigt deine Genehmigung.\nÖffne Systemeinstellungen → Anmeldeobjekte & Erweiterungen, suche „LookInside Injector“, schalte ihn ein und versuche es dann noch einmal."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The LookInside Injector daemon requires your approval.\nOpen System Settings → Login Items & Extensions, locate “LookInside Injector”, and turn it on, then try again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El daemon de LookInside Injector necesita tu aprobación.\nAbre Ajustes del Sistema → Ítems de inicio y extensiones, busca “LookInside Injector”, actívalo y vuelve a intentarlo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le démon LookInside Injector nécessite votre approbation.\nOuvrez Réglages Système → Ouverture et extensions, repérez « LookInside Injector », activez-le, puis réessayez."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il daemon di LookInside Injector richiede la tua approvazione.\nApri Impostazioni di Sistema → Elementi login ed estensioni, trova “LookInside Injector”, attivalo e riprova."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "LookInside Injectorデーモンには承認が必要です。\nシステム設定の“ログイン項目と機能拡張”を開き、“LookInside Injector”をオンにしてから、もう一度お試しください。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "LookInside Injector 데몬에 승인이 필요합니다.\n시스템 설정 → 로그인 항목 및 확장 프로그램을 열고 “LookInside Injector”를 찾아 켠 다음 다시 시도하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O daemon do LookInside Injector precisa da sua aprovação.\nAbra Ajustes do Sistema → Itens de Início e Extensões, encontre “LookInside Injector”, ative-o e tente novamente."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Демон LookInside Injector требует вашего подтверждения.\nОткройте Системные настройки → «Объекты входа и расширения», найдите «LookInside Injector», включите его и повторите попытку."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Daemon LookInside Injector cần bạn phê duyệt.\nMở Cài đặt hệ thống → Mục đăng nhập và tiện ích mở rộng, tìm “LookInside Injector”, bật lên rồi thử lại."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "LookInside Injector 守护进程需要你的批准。\n打开“系统设置”→“登录项与扩展”，找到“LookInside Injector”并将它打开，然后重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "LookInside 注入器常駐程式需要你的核准。\n開啟「系統設定」→「登入項目與延伸功能」，找到「LookInside 注入器」並將它開啟，然後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The LookInside Injector daemon returned an unsupported status (%d)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
